        <body>
            <div xml:id="d68">

                <pb facs="0226" n="1186" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1186"/>

                <head>No. 781.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bragg to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 14, 1888</date>.
                        (Received April 21.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 23.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor herewith to inclose to you
                    translated copy of reply received from Mr. Mariscal to my note (No. 20) relating
                    to the invasion of American soil at Eagle Pass by Mexican officers and
                    soldiers.</p>
                <p>When the information promised by Mr. Mariscal reaches me it will be promptly
                    forwarded to you.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwd. S. Bragg.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d68-a1.xml" xpointer="d68-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
